{
  "id": "unique-event-002",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "  #2 - Desecrated church\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,860,885]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "This place of worship has been\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,885,916]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "turned into its opposite. Roll d6 to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,916,953]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "determine what is going on:\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,953,981]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1-3) Human sacrifice! There are 2d6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,981,1017]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "L2 cultists. You may choose to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1017,1048]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Escape but if you do, you lose 2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1048,1081]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Sanity and there is a 2 in 6 chance\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1081,1117]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of a cultist chasing you to fight.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1117,1152]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Every time you come back to the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1152,1184]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "church, roll a 2 in 6 chance that they\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1184,1223]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "are still there.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1223,1240]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4-5) There is no one in the church\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1240,1275]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "right now. If you know an exorcism,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1275,1311]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you may re-consecrate the church\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1311,1344]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "with a L5 Magic roll. Add +1 if you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1344,1380]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have the Occultism and +2 if you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1380,1413]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have Occultism at Expert level. If\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1413,1448]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the Save fails, a random monster\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1448,1481]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "from the Demonic Horrors Table\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1481,1512]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "will attack you. If you re-consecrate\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1512,1550]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the church, increase permanently\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1550,1583]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "your Sanity by 1 (this is a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1583,1611]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "permanent increase), gain 1 XP and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1611,1646]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "find 2 vials of holy water.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1646,1674]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6) Save vs. L4 curse (add +1 if you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1674,1710]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have the Will Skill, +2 if you have it\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1710,1749]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "at Expert level). If you fail, you are\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1749,1788]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Cursed. You will be at -1 on all saves\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1788,1827]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "until you perform any action that\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1827,1861]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "increases your Sanity (like 4-5\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1861,1893]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "above). When that happens, the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1893,1924]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "curse will be broken. You may also\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1924,1959]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "find rituals or magic item letting\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1959,1994]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-002:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you remove a curse.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[77,1994,2014]]"
    }
  ],
